title: loadZone
---
<<declare $dialoguePhase = "">>
<<declare $visitedYet = false>>
<<dialoguePhaseSetter NPC>>
<<if $dialoguePhase == "start">>
    <<jump Start>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase == "questTaken">>
    <<jump InProgress>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase == "questDenied">>
    <<jump ReturnChat>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase == "questComplete">>
    <<jump QuestComplete>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase == "questReturn">>
    <<jump CompletedReturn>>
//<<else>>
//Npc: Error Error FIX YA SHII
<<endif>>
===

title: Start
---
<<set $visitedYet to true>>
<<camMove NPC_CamRig "npc">>
Npc: W-WhAT? Where'd you come from!?
Npc: How in the hell did you get into my humble abode!?
<<camMove NPC_CamRig "pc">>
    -> Um... the door?
         <<camMove NPC_CamRig "npc">>
    -> Oh I'm sorry! I didn't mean to startle you.
         <<camMove NPC_CamRig "npc">>
Npc: Hmm... Well no matter. Welcome, welcome! Do make yourself comfortable, please. 
Npc: Where do you come from my darling?
<<camMove NPC_CamRig "pc">>
    -> I… Well I guess I'm not too sure myself.
         <<camMove NPC_CamRig "npc">>
    -> From outside, duh.
         <<camMove NPC_CamRig "npc">>
    -> It doesn't matter, cuz I'm here now!
         <<camMove NPC_CamRig "npc">>
Npc: I see… well since you're here now, you might as well help me out…
Npc: I'm terribly afraid that I've really screwed the pooch on this one!
<<camMove NPC_CamRig "pc">>
    -> Whatever it is, I'm sure I can help you!
         <<camMove NPC_CamRig "return">>
         <<jump  Filler>>
    -> Ugh fine I guess
         <<camMove NPC_CamRig "return">>
         <<jump Filler>>
    -> Nope! I'm out!
         <<dialoguePhaseGetter NPC "questDenied">>
         <<camMove NPC_CamRig "return">>

===

title: Filler
--- 
<<camMove NPC_CamRig "npc">>
Npc: Well lets see… not too long ago I was sitting here in my chair, enjoying the fire and knitting hats for my little sweeties…
Npc: Oh my,I jumped up right quick when I realized! I had forgotten about dinner!
Npc: I rushed over to my babies, they sleep in that little bed right there, you see
Npc: But Oh! The horrors! My darling angels were nowhere to be found!
Npc: My sweet little babies… my poor darling things! 
<<camMove NPC_CamRig "pc">>
-> Oh no! How Horrible! How can I help?
     <<camMove NPC_CamRig "return">>
     <<jump Quest>>
-> Seems like you should pay better attention…
     <<camMove NPC_CamRig "npc">>
	Npc: Oh my! Well how… rude! My my you are certainly something..
        <<camMove NPC_CamRig "pc">>
	    -> shrug  
             <<camMove NPC_CamRig "return">>
             <<jump Quest>>      
	    -> I'm just saying… but what do you need help with?
             <<camMove NPC_CamRig "return">>
             <<jump Quest>>
        -> Yeah... I'm not helping you. 
            Npc: Ok just let my poor little kitties suffer then...
                <<camMove NPC_CamRig "return">>
                <<dialoguePhaseGetter NPC "questDenied">>
     
		
===

title: ReturnChat
---
<<camMove NPC_CamRig "npc">>
Npc: Well well well, look who comes crawling back...
Npc: It seems like you <i>Do<i> care for my little kitties after all!
Npc: Finally willing to help?
<<camMove NPC_CamRig "pc">>
    -> Yeah sure!
         <<camMove NPC_CamRig "return">>
         <<jump Quest>>
    -> I guess I could...
         <<camMove NPC_CamRig "return">>
         <<jump Quest>>
    -> Mmmm nahhhh I'm good.
         <<camMove NPC_CamRig "return">> 
===
title: Quest
---
<<camMove NPC_CamRig "npc">>
Npc: I need you to help me find my precious little kitties! Oh please won't you help?
Npc: I don't know where they ran off to! They really like to play around in boxes and climb on my shelves, but I'd reckon some ran outside too!
Npc: Please find my babies and bring them back home!
<<camMove NPC_CamRig "pc">>
    -> Awww of course I'll help! They'll be home in no time, don't you worry!
        <<camMove NPC_CamRig "npc">>
    -> Damn that really sucks… Sure, I'll go find them. 
        <<camMove NPC_CamRig "npc">>
    -> You really should be more careful next time… I'll help you, but just this once!
        <<camMove NPC_CamRig "npc">>
Npc: Oh thank you so much! I'll have something extra special waiting for you if you can really find them all!
Npc: Please darling, bring them home to me…
<<camMove NPC_CamRig "return">>
<<dialoguePhaseGetter NPC "questTaken">>

===

title: InProgress
---
<<camMove NPC_CamRig "npc">>
Npc: Have you found them all?!? 
Npc: No? You haven't..? 
Npc: WELL GET BACK OUT THERE AND FIND MY BABIES!!!
<<camMove NPC_CamRig "return">>

===

title: QuestComplete
---
<<camMove NPC_CamRig "npc">>
Npc: Oh YES!! MY BABIIIEEESSS!!!!
Npc: Come to mama! Oh my sweeties! Helloooo, yes yes, welcome home my darlings.
Npc: Did they give you too much trouble? 
<<camMove NPC_CamRig "pc">>
    -> Oh not at all! They're the sweetest little things!
        <<camMove NPC_CamRig "npc">>
    -> Only a few scratches, nothing I can't handle.
        <<camMove NPC_CamRig "npc">>
    -> Sigh… no it was easy. 
        <<camMove NPC_CamRig "npc">>
Npc: Well thank you! Thank you so much!
Npc: Here, as a token of my appreciation…
Npc: I made you this scarf! I knit it while you were out! Oh and it will just look so wonderful on you!
<<camMove NPC_CamRig "pc">>
    -> Thank you so much! I'll be so stylish now!
        <<camMove NPC_CamRig "npc">>
    -> Aww thanks, that's very kind.
        <<camMove NPC_CamRig "npc">>
    -> I mean I guess I'll take it… thanks?
        <<camMove NPC_CamRig "npc">>
Npc: You are welcome! And thank you again, thank you so much!
Npc: Now shoo! Scram! Get outta my house!
<<camMove NPC_CamRig "return">>
<<dialoguePhaseGetter NPC "questReturn">>

===

title: CompletedReturn
---
<<camMove NPC_CamRig "npc">>
Npc: Thanks again for your help darling!
Npc: Stop by again whenever!
<<camMove NPC_CamRig "return">>
===